{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is the demo version of our cozy adventure game Bura: The Way the Wind Blows. You have full freedom to explore the beautiful Mediterranean coastal town and nature around it. Your goal is to find all four pieces of Glagolitic board, the oldest known Slavic alphabet. That is the key to unlock the shrine to the spirits of the nature from Adriatic mythology.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is the very beginning of the game, about 45 minutes of gameplay. This demo includes mechanics from the full game, such as gliding, diving, and jumping, but the most fun part are the four spirit abilities you unlock by collecting seeds. Can you find all the seeds and uncover secrets of this cozy adventure?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498600/extras/steamHeaders_Development.eng.png?t=1740914616\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>EXPLORATION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play at your own pace, explore freely while enjoying small details of Mediterranean nature. Traverse land, sea and sky, and collect the memories along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498600/extras/Steam_Exploration.gif?t=1740914616\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>ENJOY THE MOMENT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Feel the hot summer day, breathe in fresh smell of the pine trees, jump into crystal clear sea. Notice the small details around you and learn to just live in the moment. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498600/extras/Steam_Enjoy.gif?t=1740914616\" /> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>MEET THE SPIRIT OF THE WILDERNESS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Spirits inspired by old Croatian folk tales are all around you, can you find them all?  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Learn about them and unravel their secrets. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498600/extras/Steam_Movement.gif?t=1740914616\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Follow the tale about growing up and overcoming the challenges of life. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Learn Croatian and Mediterranean legends first-hand from the creatures that inhabit them and discover lost cultural monuments and traditions.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3498600?t=1740914616","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3498600?t=1740914616","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498600/479884f7305fbe46e1327470d1e3e470f1ec320e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1740914616","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498600/479884f7305fbe46e1327470d1e3e470f1ec320e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1740914616","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is the demo version of our cozy adventure game Bura: The Way the Wind Blows. You have full freedom to explore the beautiful Mediterranean coastal town and nature around it. Your goal is to find all four pieces of Glagolitic board, the oldest known Slavic alphabet. That is the key to unlock the shrine to the spirits of the nature from Adriatic mythology.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is the very beginning of the game, about 45 minutes of gameplay. This demo includes mechanics from the full game, such as gliding, diving, and jumping, but the most fun part are the four spirit abilities you unlock by collecting seeds. Can you find all the seeds and uncover secrets of this cozy adventure?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498600/extras/steamHeaders_Development.eng.png?t=1740914616\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>EXPLORATION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play at your own pace, explore freely while enjoying small details of Mediterranean nature. Traverse land, sea and sky, and collect the memories along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498600/extras/Steam_Exploration.gif?t=1740914616\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>ENJOY THE MOMENT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Feel the hot summer day, breathe in fresh smell of the pine trees, jump into crystal clear sea. Notice the small details around you and learn to just live in the moment. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498600/extras/Steam_Enjoy.gif?t=1740914616\" /> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>MEET THE SPIRIT OF THE WILDERNESS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Spirits inspired by old Croatian folk tales are all around you, can you find them all?  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Learn about them and unravel their secrets. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498600/extras/Steam_Movement.gif?t=1740914616\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Follow the tale about growing up and overcoming the challenges of life. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Learn Croatian and Mediterranean legends first-hand from the creatures that inhabit them and discover lost cultural monuments and traditions.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["Tiny Meow studio","Raven Insights"],"fullgame":{"appid":"2006540","name":"Bura: The Way the Wind Blows"},"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498600/b0e0d4f3f7f4b0208251c8bdf4fda976eb231ade/header.jpg?t=1740914616","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257101878,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257101878/movie480.mp4?t=1740419377","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257101878/movie_max.mp4?t=1740419377"},"name":"Gameplay trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257101878/8d2f562e8b9589e9499f6579692d1fef0f993f60/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1740419377","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257101878/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1740419377","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257101878/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1740419377"}}],"name":"Bura: The Way the Wind Blows Demo","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> i5-8300H<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8000 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 1660<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2000 MB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Ryzen 5 5600X<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16000 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> RTX 3070<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2000 MB available 